@startuml layers
title apps/starchess — import layers (enforced by .dependency-cruiser.cjs)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "routes" {
  [screens] as screens
  [demos] as demos
}
package "app side" {
  [app] as app
  [tutorial] as tutorial
  [achievements] as ach
}
package "presentation" {
  [animations] as anim
  [pieces] as pieces
  [board / combat / hud / specials / timeline] as pres
}
package "components" {
  [features] as features
  [atoms] as atoms
  [primitives] as prims
}
[store (UI-wide flags)] as store
[hooks] as hooks
[adapters] as adapters
[types] as types

screens --> demos
screens --> app
demos --> app
app --> pres
app --> components
pres --> anim
anim --> pieces
pres --> components
features --> atoms
atoms --> prims
pres --> store
components --> store
app --> adapters
pres --> adapters

pieces -[#red,dashed]-> anim : pieces-below-animations
prims -[#red,dashed]-> pres : primitives-stay-presentational
atoms -[#red,dashed]-> features : atoms-below-features
components -[#red,dashed]-> screens : components-below-routes
pres -[#red,dashed]-> app : presentation-below-app
store -[#red,dashed]-> pres : store-below-ui
types -[#red,dashed]-> app : types-are-leaves

note right of pres
  No known violations (2026-09-27). The
  30-edge presentation → app baseline was paid
  off in three PRs (specials · hud · board+combat):
  • store context → ~/ports/matchStore
  • match reads → store.view (MatchView, ~/types/match)
  • store-free rules → starchess-core rules/economy
  • intentOverlayPolicy → presentation/combat
    (only presentation used it)
  • achievement bubbles → a context match hosts
    provide (AchievementBubblesProvider)
  • PromotionModal → components/features
    (it composes PieceGlyph)
end note

note bottom
  pnpm lint runs oxlint, then check:deps: any violation fails (no baseline).
  Type-only imports are exempt everywhere (they vanish at runtime);
  cycles are judged on runtime edges only.
  timers-through-adapter: only adapters/ and MatchStoreContext import adapters/browser.
end note
@enduml
